## Dispatcher Configuration

> [!TIP]
> `SamplesDispatcher` update interval is **configurable** (25–100 ms). Default: **50 ms (20 Hz)**. This can be adjusted based on measured latency/CPU trade-offs via [config.py](file:///d:/Projects/Sound_Gen/x_muse/src/sound_gen_hub/config.py).

```python
# config.py
DISPATCHER_INTERVAL_MS = 50  # Default 20 Hz, adjustable 25-100ms
```

