## Extensibility

Adding new devices (e.g., Pixel watch, ring, bracer) requires only:

1. New `*Source` class with [connect()](file:///d:/Projects/Sound_Gen/x_gsr/src/gsr_hub/acquisition/interfaces.py#21-24), [read_chunk()](file:///d:/Projects/Sound_Gen/x_ecg/src/ecg_hub/interfaces.py#28-39), [close()](file:///d:/Projects/Sound_Gen/x_gsr/src/gsr_hub/acquisition/gsr_source.py#71-74)
2. New `*Runner` extending `BaseSensorRunner`
3. New `SensorDescriptor` registered in `SensorManager`
4. New chart component in frontend
5. No WebSocket protocol changes needed
